<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<title>Master Oros — Simulador MLB Pro por Fases (Abridor y Bullpen)</title>

<style>
:root{
 --bg:#121212;--card:#1e1e1e;--text:#e0e0e0;--muted:#9e9e9e;
 --line:#2c2c2c;--accent:#2196f3;--ok:#4caf50;--purple:#bb86fc;--warn:#ff9800
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{
 margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);
 font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,Arial,sans-serif
}
.wrap{max-width:1150px;margin:auto;padding:14px}
header,.panel,.results,.team-panel{
 background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--line);
 border-radius:14px;padding:15px;margin-bottom:14px
}
h1{margin:0 0 5px;font-size:23px;color:#fff}
h2{margin:0 0 12px;font-size:18px;color:#fff}
<h3>{margin:0;font-size:15px;color:#fff}
.note{color:var(--muted);line-height:1.45;font-size:13px}
.toolbar,.actions{
 display:flex;gap:9px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:end
}
.control{min-width:165px;flex:1}
label{
 display:block;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:4px;color:var(--muted)
}
input,select,button{
 width:100%;padding:10px;border:1px solid #333;
 border-radius:9px;font:inherit;background:#2a2a2a;color:#fff
}
button{cursor:pointer;font-weight:700}
.primary{background:var(--accent);color:#fff;border-color:var(--accent)}
.ok{background:var(--ok);color:#fff;border-color:var(--ok)}
.status{
 padding:10px;border-radius:9px;background:#1a2332;margin-top:10px;color:#90caf9;font-size:13px
}
.teams{
 display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:14px
}
.team-panel.local{border-top:4px solid #4caf50}
.team-panel.visitor{border-top:4px solid #ff9800}
.team-head{
 display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;
 margin-bottom:10px
}
.badge{
 font-size:11px;font-weight:800;padding:3px 7px;
 border-radius:99px;background:#2c2c2c;color:#fff
}
.metrics{
 display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px
}
.alt-pitcher-box{
 grid-column: span 2;background:#25221b;border:1px solid #4a3820;padding:10px;border-radius:8px;margin-top:4px
}
.result-grid{
 display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(180px,1fr));
 gap:9px
}
.result{
 border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;padding:10px;background:#252525
}
.result b{display:block;margin-bottom:4px;color:#fff}
.audit{
 margin-top:10px;padding:10px;border-radius:9px;
 background:#222;border:1px solid var(--line);
 font-size:12px;line-height:1.5
}
.bet-card{
 background:#262626;border:1px solid #3a3a3a;border-radius:10px;padding:12px;margin-top:8px
}
.bet-title{font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:8px;text-transform:uppercase}
.bet-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:8px}
.bet-option{
 background:#323232;border:1px solid #444;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;text-align:center
}
.bet-option span{display:block;font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}
.bet-option b{font-size:14px;color:#fff}
.parlay-box{
 background:#1e182e;border:1px solid #4a2872;border-radius:10px;padding:14px;margin-top:12px
}
.good{color:var(--ok);font-weight:700}
.purple-text{color:var(--purple);font-weight:700}
.warn-text{color:var(--warn);font-weight:700}
@media(max-width:760px){
 .teams,.metrics{grid-template-columns:1fr}
 .wrap{padding:9px}
}
</style>
</head>

<body>

<div class="wrap">

<header>

<h1>Master Oros — Simulador MLB Pro por Fases de Juego</h1>

<div class="note">
Motor con simulación escalonada: Fase 1 (Abridor oficial en entradas 1 a 6) y Fase 2 (Transición y Bullpen en entradas 7 a 9).
</div>

<div class="toolbar" style="margin-top:12px">
<div class="control">
<label>Simulaciones</label>
<select id="sims">
<option>1000</option>
<option>5000</option>
<option selected>25000</option>
<option>50000</option>
<option>100000</option>
</select>
</div>
